[Tips.CRTディスプレイ風]
effect.name=Apply a CRT display-like effect to a video.\n\n## Acknowledgements\n\nThis script is based on [CRTディスプレイの再現 - ideoaves](https://ideoaves.github.io/blog/2025-12-10.html).\nThank you to hazuqu for granting permission for the port.\n
PI=- `horizontal_blur`: Horizontal blur\n- `rgb_percent`: RGB effect strength (%)\n- `pixel_size`: Pixel size\n- `decay`: Decay\n- `slowmotion`: Slow motion\n- `use_progressive`: Whether to use progressive scanning\n
